[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 14582.87, "timestamp": "04:03:02", "text": "完全不堪一击。弄得一团糟。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14587.349, "timestamp": "04:03:07", "text": "破坏化粪池。好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14591.75, "timestamp": "04:03:11", "text": "喷泉。啊，多么美好的日子！回收"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14600.95, "timestamp": "04:03:20", "text": "杀了它。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14604.469, "timestamp": "04:03:24", "text": "哦，给你买点东西。我该杀了它吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14606.229, "timestamp": "04:03:26", "text": "我应该让他们完成这项工作吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14618.55, "timestamp": "04:03:38", "text": "太脏了，我根本清理不干净。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14621.91, "timestamp": "04:03:41", "text": "我自己的。我力不从心了。哟，B，让我们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14623.11, "timestamp": "04:03:43", "text": "带我离开这里。然后你和你的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14625.03, "timestamp": "04:03:45", "text": "哥们儿们可以把这破箱子都清理干净。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14629.269, "timestamp": "04:03:49", "text": "你想要。放我出去。这是怎么回事？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14633.91, "timestamp": "04:03:53", "text": "三、二、一，掌握。哦，不，不"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14636.389, "timestamp": "04:03:56", "text": "不，不，不，不，不。"}]